attach
1-9          saved query           ctrl+k commands
g            where to go           ?      help
g 1-9        switch view           q      quit
ctrl+, / g s settings
g i          jump to an issue
esc          back
r            refresh
R            refetch everything

backlog
space pick or unpick this issue                       ↓/j  down         ctrl+d half page down ...
v     pick every issue in this section                ↑/k  up           ctrl+u half page up
m     move these issues to a sprint or the backlog    pgdn page down    g g    first row
c     create an issue in this section                 pgup page up      G      last row
/     find an issue
M     only my issues
f     filter by a person, a status, a label
s     sort

board
enter open                                     ↓/j down               pgdn    page down                 ...
m     move this issue to another column        ↑/k up                 pgup    page up
c     create an issue in this column           ←/h previous column    g g     first card in this column
/     find a card                              →/l next column        G / g e last card in this column
M     only my issues
b     another board of this project
f     filter by a person, a status, a label
F 1-9 quick filters

